1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,055
This is what a normal day looked like.

2
00:00:02,055 --> 00:00:03,190
I didn't know it yet.

3
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:05,736
My alarm went off at seven.

4
00:00:05,736 --> 00:00:08,160
I hit snooze twice, like always.

5
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:11,850
I brushed my teeth in the same mirror, with
the same face.

6
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:15,196
Walked to the bus stop past the same
houses.

7
00:00:15,196 --> 00:00:17,460
The same cat sat on the same fence.

8
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,135
Afternoon cartoons.

9
00:00:19,135 --> 00:00:22,350
Then the news said a city name I had never
heard of.

10
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:23,710
I changed the channel.

11
00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:27,167
I sat on the porch until the streetlights came
on.

12
00:00:27,167 --> 00:00:29,000
It was the best day I ever had.

13
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,302
That night I left my window open.

14
00:00:31,302 --> 00:00:33,651
Someone was standing under the
streetlight.

15
00:00:33,651 --> 00:00:35,890
I figured they were waiting for a friend.
